11
00:00:20,297 --> 00:00:22,687
Drilling began in 1970.

12
00:00:23,184 --> 00:00:24,689
The hole is only twenty three

13
00:00:24,709 --> 00:00:25,794
centimetres wide.

14
00:00:26,094 --> 00:00:27,288
About the size of a dinner

15
00:00:27,308 --> 00:00:27,764
